title: "GBEM: Geospatial Building Energy Mapping"
abstract: "Code for estimating and mapping building energy efficiency from Earth observation and geospatial data, and the analysis pipeline for a systematic review of remote sensing and geospatial methods for building energy efficiency assessment. Developed as part of a PhD project at Ulster University."
